==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro}} {{term|derogacion|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|derogatio|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˌdɛɹəˈgeɪʃən/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An act which [[belittle]]s; [[disparagement]].
# {{context|legal|lang=en}} The act of [[derogating]]; the temporary or partial nullification of a law.

